    "updated_at": "2018-07-03T04:22:30Z",
    "body": "> Note, though, the sandbox error is more about accessing the cross-origin iframe's contentWindow. It might be better to change the test so that the child frame postMessage()'s the controller scriptURL to the parent.\r\n\r\nThat's right. But we shouldn't make the iframe navigate. Maybe should I use srcdoc that postMessage() to the parent? In that case, the inherited controller should hold, right?",
